<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 74.9500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 74.9500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 74.9500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.7000 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Apr 21		  Apr 18</p>
<p> High			     75.3300		 75.8000</p>
<p> Low				74.8700		 75.3200</p>
<p> Open			     75.3300		 75.3200</p>
<p> Close			    74.9500		 75.7000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    7.010		   7.605</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
